<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA FAVOURITES TO WIN ASHES SERIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA FAVOURITES TO WIN ASHES SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bookmakers have installed Australia as 10-11 favourites to win the six-match Ashes series following their 268-run win in the third test at Old Trafford on Monday.</p>
<p>England were quoted at 12-5 and a drawn series 9-4.</p>
<p>The series is currently level 1-1.</p>
</text>
